    "key": "e85740de252404917d4bf30dc2fab5f6764990815d6368bf1b8b90b8bda42238",
    "original": "[p=c][img]gfx/ui/events/rf_random_solo_intro.png[/img][/p][p]A random start into the world.\n\n[color=#bcad8c]Random Start:[/color] Start with a single random character.\n[color=#bcad8c]Avatar:[/color] If your starting character dies, the campaign ends.\n[color=#bcad8c]Talented:[/color] Your starting character is level 4 and always has 3 stars in his talents.[/p]",
    "translation": "[p=c][img]gfx/ui/events/rf_random_solo_intro.png[/img][/p][p]以随机的开始进入世界。\n\n[color=#bcad8c]随机开始：[/color]以一名随机角色开始游戏。\n[color=#bcad8c]化身：[/color]如果你的初始角色死了，战役就结束了。\n[color=#bcad8c]天赋异禀：[/color]初始角色等级为4，天赋等级都是3星。[/p]",
    "stage": 1,
    "context": "this.m.Description = \"[p=c][img]gfx/ui/events/rf_random_solo_intro.png[/img][/p][p]A random start into the world.\n\n[color=#bcad8c]Random Start:[/color] Start with a single random character.\n[color=#bcad8c]Avatar:[/color] If your starting character dies, the campaign ends.\n[color=#bcad8c]Talented:[/color] Your starting character is level 4 and always has 3 stars in his talents.[/p]\""
  }
